{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-algebraic-primality","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:algebraic-primality","kind":"definition","title":"Algebraic primality of a strand count","tags":["magic-numbers","primality","tensor-irreducibility","confinement-sdp","naming"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Interactions.AlgebraicPrimality.IsAlgebraicallyPrime","text":"algebraic-primality.md","leanSource":"algebraic-primality.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:algebraic-primality\"></a><p><em>Fix a substrate parameter <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q > 1</code>. For each strand count <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n \\geq 1</code>, the confinement SDP selects a canonical state <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\psi_n(q)</code>. Say that <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n</code> is <strong>algebraically prime at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code></strong> if <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\psi_n(q)</code> is not contained in the closed span of any non-trivial tensor product</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\overline{\\mathrm{span}}\\bigl\\{\\,\n    \\psi_{n_1}(q) \\otimes \\cdots \\otimes \\psi_{n_k}(q)\n  \\,\\bigr\\}.</code></pre>\n<p><em>This product is indexed by a decomposition <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n = n_1 + \\cdots + n_k</code> with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k \\geq 2</code> and every <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n_i \\geq 1</code>.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/algebraic-primality.md","heading":"Definition","number":"14.2.26","page":"b/def-algebraic-primality","qa":{"counts":{"pass":87,"fail":0,"warn":2,"na":17,"unknown":0,"stale":79},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Confinement.AlgebraicPrimality.IsAlgebraicallyPrime","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/algebraic-primality.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
